# The packaged build serves the frontend and the API from ONE process on
# whatever port was free, so every API call must be a relative path. Baking in
# a fixed port is how the app breaks on a machine that already uses 8000.
#
# `next dev` does not read this file: there the API really is on another origin
# (:8000) and lib/api.ts falls back to the absolute address.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=/
